"Federation" means the Federal Republic of Nigeria ;
"function" includes powers and duties ;
"general election" means an election held in the Federation at large
which may be at all levels, and at regular intervals to select officers to
serve after the expiration of the full terms of their predecessors ;
"Government" includes the Government of the Federation, a State, Local
Government Area or Area Council, or any person or or gan exercising
power or authority on its behalf ;
"House" or "Legislative House" means the Senate, House of
Representatives, House of Assembly of a State and includes the Legislative
