"transmit" means to send, transfer or communicate from one person or
place to another manually or electronically ;
"unmarked ballot paper" means a ballot paper that has not been marked
by the voter to indicate their choice of candidate or option ;
"vulnerable person" means a woman, child or person living under
extreme poverty, person with disability, the sick and the elderly, refugee,
internally displaced person, migrant, person in detention or ethnic and
